      "receiptSource": "Original Receipt in \u0027\u003Ci\u003EThe Accomplisht Cook\u003C/i\u003E\u0027 by Robert May, 1660 (\u003Ca href=\u0022references.html#robert-may-1660\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003ERobert May 1660\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E);",
      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ETo make a Pudding in haste.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nTake a pint of good Milk or Cream, put thereto a handful of raisins of the Sun, with as many currans, and a piece of butter, then grate a manchet and a nutmeg, and put thereto a handful of flour; when the milk boils, put in the bread, let it boil a quarter of an hour, then dish it up on \u003Ca href=\u0022butter-sauce.html\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003Ebeaten butter\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E.\u003Cbr\u003E"
